{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"生象环"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"生象环"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>传统</h3>\n<p>生象环的范畴是单纯环的范畴关于弱等价的"},{"Local":{"url":"局部化(范畴论)","text":"局部化"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}